her adjustment to a new life in  california it is narrated by 11 in the  form of a letter to mike wheeler though  the text of the letter is far more  hopeful and positive than what the  audience has shown meanwhile in a teaser  trailer titled 11 are you listening a  man who appears to be dr martin brenner  aka popper walks through a hallway and  speaks to a group of children who  presumably have powers similar to 11.  good morning children  how are you today  good  the camera eventually makes its way to a  door with 11 on it and papa asks 11 are  you listening a spooked 11 opens her  eyes it remains to be seen if this is a  flashback featuring previously  unreleased information or if the doctor  is up to his old tricks in the present  day another sneak peek trailer released  in the summer of 2021 shows a series of  seemingly random events from previous  seasons of stranger things intercut with  clips from season four there's also a  trailer titled creole house which  features a happy family moving into our  house before unexplainable supernatural  events begin to terrorize the family  flash forward to the present where we  see some of the mainstay characters of  stranger things enter a beaten up and  abandoned house looking for mysterious  clues which may lead them to the upside  down  though season 4 will be split into two  parts netflix was kind enough to reveal  all nine episode titles for the upcoming  season in the title tease trailer they  are the hellfire club veganist curse the  monster and the superhero dear billy the  nina project the dive the massacre at  hawkins lab popper and the piggyback  despite all the titles being intriguing  it's interesting that episode 4 is  titled dear billy since he's presumed  dead that said it's not out to the  question but some flashback scenes have  believed to occur though that's based on  speculation of course popper is the name  of the doctor who raced 11 and the  viewers were already gifted with a  teaser trailer featuring the mad  scientist as to what the rest of the  episode titles might refer to fans are  already combing through the show for  clues  the world is full of obvious things  which nobody by any chance ever observes  there's good and bad news here first and  foremost no this isn't the last season  of stranger things however season 5 is  scheduled to conclude the upside down  saga in a 2022 interview with scream  rant sean levy gave his reasons for the  show's inevitable ending we wanted to  only tell as much story as the brothers  saw and feel with clarity it's been  clear for a while that they know exactly  where we're headed and this is the ark  we wouldn't want to stick around for one  moment beyond that vision and the  clarity of that voice it's not easy  saying bye to this uber popular series  but characters like 11 hopper and the  rest of the stranger things family  deserve a happy ending they have by all  standards been through an awful lot with  that said the duffer brothers teased  other stories to tell in the stranger  things universe in an open letter to  fans shared by netflix perhaps spin-off  or films will be on the horizon  as mentioned in the duffer brothers  letter shared by netflix they might be  ending the series after five seasons but  that doesn't necessarily mean the  franchise is coming to an end if  anything it sounds like this is just the  beginning although repeating the success  creativity and intrigue of the inaugural  series will take some magic the letter  said in part there are still many more  exciting stories to tell within the  world of stranger things new mysteries  new adventures new unexpected heroes but  first we hope you stay with us as we  finish this tale of a powerful girl  named eleven and her brave friends of a  broken police chief and a ferocious mom  of a small town called hawkins and an  alternate dimension known only as the  upside down as always we are grateful  for your patience and support season 4  isn't the end and if this letter is any  indicator perhaps other stories in this  universe will eventually make their way  to the masses volume 1 will hit netflix  on may 27th and volume 2 will be  released shortly after on july 1st  season 4 is almost upon us and we can't  wait to see what's in store  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite television shows are  coming soon subscribe to our youtube  channel and hit the bell so you don't  miss a single one  [Music]

